        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment. I hereby establish within the Office of Management \nand Budget (OMB) a Transition Planning Office for the Department of Home-\nland Security (the ‘‘Transition Planning Office’’), to be headed by the Director \nof the Transition Planning Office for the Department of Homeland Security \n(the ‘‘Director for Transition Planning’’)."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1349,
      "char_start": 1271,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Missions. The missions of the Transition Planning Office shall be \nto:"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1570,
      "char_start": 1351,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec2-a",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(a)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec2-a",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(a) coordinate, guide, and conduct transition and related planning through-\nout the executive branch of the United States Government in preparation \nfor establishment of the proposed Department of Homeland Security; and"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1696,
      "char_start": 1572,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec2-b",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec2-b",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) consistent with Presidential guidance, work with the Congress as it \nconsiders legislation to establish that Department."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2137,
      "char_start": 1698,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Administration. (a) The Director of OMB shall ensure that the Transi-\ntion Planning Office receives appropriate personnel (including detailees and \nassignees, as appropriate), funding, and administrative support for the Office, \nsubject to the availability of appropriations. The Director of OMB is author-\nized to make expenditures under section 522 of title 31, United States \nCode, as may be appropriate to carry out this order."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2541,
      "char_start": 2139,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec3-b",
      "kind": "subsection",
      "label": "(b)",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec3-b",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(b) If an individual who is an Assistant to the President is appointed \nto serve simultaneously as Director for Transition Planning, the functioning, \npersonnel, funds, records, and property of the office of the Assistant to \nthe President and the office of the Director for Transition Planning shall \nbe kept separate in the same manner as if the two offices were headed \nby two different individuals."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3168,
      "char_start": 2543,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Other Departments and Agencies. This order does not alter the \nexisting authorities of United States Government departments and agencies. \nIn carrying out the missions set forth in section 2 of this order, all executive \ndepartments and agencies are directed to assist the Director for Transition \nPlanning and the Transition Planning Office to the extent permitted by \nlaw. \nVerDate May<23>2002 08:48 Jun 21, 2002 Jkt 197001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4790 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\24JNE1.SGM pfrm17 PsN: 24JNE1\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n42470 Federal Register / Vol. 67, No. 121 / Monday, June 24, 2002 / Presidential Documents"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3459,
      "char_start": 3170,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13267#sec5",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 5.",
      "pdf_page": 2,
      "scope_id": "EO:13267#sec5",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "67 FR 42469, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "45b1d3acd40d700fe5bddfa402ba0e1fbde22d6bfa4aca5d1cd35594cdcac5a9",
        "signing_date": "2002-06-20",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13267.txt",
        "text_sha256": "9dfc04d86ce86ae94ac1534d6f800ed2ad5d96baa7b5ff6e04966e73f2095d68",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2002-06-24/pdf/02-16041.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 5. Termination. The Transition Planning Office, and all the authorities \nof this order, shall terminate within 90 days after the date on which legisla-\ntion creating the Department of Homeland Security is enacted, or within \n1 year of the date of this order, whichever occurs first.\nW"
    }
  ],
